#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/structure/_index.adoc:264
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The FreeBSD project recognizes contributors in several different lists in "
"the documentation and in printed materials.  This section describes how the "
"documentation team manages changes to these lists."
msgstr "FreeBSD 项目在文档和印刷材料中的多个名单中列出贡献者。本节介绍文档团队如何管理这些名单的变更。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/structure/_index.adoc:265
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Mentor and New Committer Relationship Lists"
msgstr "导师与新提交者关系名单"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/structure/_index.adoc:269
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Since FreeBSD 7.0, FreeBSD has maintained link:https://cgit.freebsd.org/src/"
"tree/share/misc[three lists of contributor mentor / mentee relationships] - "
"one for source code, one for ports and one for documentation.  These files "
"are in *\".dot\"* format, intended for use with the popular graphing toolkit "
"package:graphics/graphviz[] available as a FreeBSD package or port."
msgstr "自 FreeBSD 7.0 起，FreeBSD 一直维护 link:https://cgit.freebsd.org/src/tree/share/misc[三份贡献者导师／学员关系名单]——分别对应源代码、ports 和文档。这些文件采用 *“.dot”* 格式，供常用的绘图工具包 package:graphics/graphviz[] 使用；该工具包可作为 FreeBSD 软件包或 Port 安装。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/structure/_index.adoc:274
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"man:dot[1] is installed as part of the package:graphics/graphviz[] package "
"or port.  The [.filename]#dot# program reads files in *\".dot\"* format and "
"creates a graphical image of the directed graph."
msgstr "man:dot[1] 随 package:graphics/graphviz[] 软件包或 Port 一同安装。[.filename]#dot# 程序读取 *“.dot”* 格式的文件，并生成有向图的图像。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/structure/_index.adoc:279
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The three files often serve as a learning experience for new committers of "
"all three teams who are instructed to add themselves, and their mentor, to "
"the appropriate file as their first commit.  Each file has a \"current\" "
"section for new committers, an \"alumni\" section for when the commit bit is "
"returned, and a \"mentor / mentee\" section showing the relationships.  The "
"format for each type of entry is explained at the top of the file."
msgstr "这三份文件通常也用于帮助三个团队的新提交者熟悉流程：他们会被要求在首次提交时将自己和导师添加到相应文件中。每个文件都包含一个供新提交者使用的“current”部分、一个在提交权限交还时使用的“alumni”部分，以及一个显示导师／学员关系的“mentor / mentee”部分。文件顶部说明了每种条目的格式。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/structure/_index.adoc:280
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "General Contributor Lists"
msgstr "一般贡献者名单"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/structure/_index.adoc:284
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"extref:{contributors}[Contributors] to FreeBSD are maintained in article "
"format.  The source file for managing the *Contributors* article file is "
"located at:"
msgstr "FreeBSD 的 extref:{contributors}[贡献者]以文章形式维护。用于管理 *Contributors* 文章的源文件位于："

#. type: delimited block - 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/structure/_index.adoc:297
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"doc\n"
" /documentation\n"
"   /content\n"
"     /{language}\n"
"       /articles\n"
"         /contributors\n"
"           [.filename]#_index.adoc# – Contains a list of include files that apply to each section.\n"
"           [.filename]#_index.po# – Translation page\n"
"           [.filename]#contrib-develinmemoriam.adoc# - content of “In Memoriam” section\n"
"           [.filename]#contrib-develinmemoriam.po# – Translation page\n"
msgstr "doc\n /documentation\n   /content\n     /{language}\n       /articles\n         /contributors\n           [.filename]#_index.adoc# – 包含适用于各个部分的包含文件列表。\n           [.filename]#_index.po# – 翻译页面\n           [.filename]#contrib-develinmemoriam.adoc# - “In Memoriam”部分的内容\n           [.filename]#contrib-develinmemoriam.po# – 翻译页面\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/structure/_index.adoc:300
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Copies of this contributors directory may exist in other content language "
"directories."
msgstr "其他内容语言目录中可能也有此贡献者目录的副本。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/structure/_index.adoc:303
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Note that the file [.filename]#contrib-develinmemoriam.adoc# is also found "
"in this directory.  See below for additional information."
msgstr "请注意，此目录中也有 [.filename]#contrib-develinmemoriam.adoc# 文件。更多信息请见下文。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/structure/_index.adoc:308
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The [.filename]#contributors/_index.adoc# file is designed as a collection "
"of include files.  The include files are listed in the Hugo specific section "
"of the source file.  The section is divided into several parts with \"ifdef::"
"\" statements.  There is a sub-section for website output and one for non-"
"website (including PDF) output."
msgstr "[.filename]#contributors/_index.adoc# 文件由多个包含文件组成。包含文件列在源文件中 Hugo 专用的部分。该部分通过多个“ifdef::”语句划分为若干部分，其中包含一个用于网站输出的子部分，以及一个用于非网站输出（包括 PDF）的子部分。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/fdp-primer/structure/_index.adoc:312
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The text for each section of the *Contributors* page contains an \"include::"
"\" statement.  For example, the entry for \"Port Manager Alumni\" is "
"`include::{include-contrib-portmgralumni}[]`.  This pulls in the text for "
"port manager alumni into the rendered output."
msgstr "*Contributors* 页面每个部分的文本都包含一条“include::”语句。例如，“Port Manager Alumni”条目为 `include::{include-contrib-portmgralumni}[]`。此语句会将 Port 管理员校友的文本引入生成的输出中。"

